<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About - QuickNotes</title>
<base target="_blank">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>QuickNotes</h1>
        <p>Your fast, simple note-taking companion.</p>
        <nav>
            <a href="index.html">Home</a>
            <a href="about.html">About</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <h2>About QuickNotes</h2>
        <p>QuickNotes is a lightweight note-taking app built for speed and simplicity. It lets you capture thoughts instantly and organize them without distractions.</p>

        <section>
            <h3>How to use QuickNotes</h3>
            <ol>
                <li>Open QuickNotes in your browser.</li>
                <li>Start typing your note in the editor.</li>
                <li>Save your note with a keyboard shortcut.</li>
                <li>Organize and review your notes anytime.</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3>Features</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Instant note capture with no sign-up required</li>
                <li>Keyboard shortcuts for faster workflows</li>
                <li>Clean, distraction-free interface</li>
                <li>Works offline in your browser</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Shortcut</th>
                    <th>Action</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Ctrl + S</td>
                    <td>Save current note</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Ctrl + N</td>
                    <td>Create a new note</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Ctrl + F</td>
                    <td>Search your notes</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3>Send feedback</h3>
            <form action="#" method="post">
                <label for="name">Name:</label>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>

                <label for="email">Email:</label>
                <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>

                <label for="message">Message:</label>
                <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>

                <button type="submit">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 QuickNotes</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>